Ghost Wolf Morph
    Events
        Unit - A unit Starts the effect of an ability
    Conditions
        (Ability being cast) Equal to ENHANCEMENT_GhostWolfMorph 
    Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Triggering unit) Equal to Nazgrek
            Then - Actions
                -------- MORPH into Ghost Wolf --------
                If ((Nazgrek is dead) Equal to True) then do (Skip remaining actions) else do (Do nothing)
                Animation - Queue Nazgrek's Spell Slam animation
                Wait 1.00 seconds
                Unit - Remove All buffs from Nazgrek
                Unit - Add Ghost (Visible) to Nazgrek
                Unit - Turn collision for Nazgrek Off.
                If ((Nazgrek is dead) Equal to True) then do (Skip remaining actions) else do (Do nothing)
                Set VariableSet NazgrekMorph = Nazgrek
                Set VariableSet NazgrekMorphing = True
                Set VariableSet VarPoint = (Position of NazgrekMorph)
                Unit - Create 1 Nazgrek (Ghost Wolf - Level 1) for Player 1 (Red) at VarPoint facing (Facing of NazgrekMorph) degrees
                Set VariableSet Nazgrek = (Last created unit)
                Animation - Queue Nazgrek's attack animation
                Animation - Queue Nazgrek's stand animation
                Player - Disable Shield Block (50) for Player 1 (Red)
                Player - Disable Shield Block (75) for Player 1 (Red)
                Player - Disable Shield Block (100) for Player 1 (Red)
                -------- Transfer level --------
                Custom script:   call AbilityPoints_DisableHeroLevelUp()
                Hero - Set Nazgrek Hero-level to (Hero level of NazgrekMorph), Hide level-up graphics
                -------- Transfer xp --------
                Hero - Set Nazgrek experience to (Hero experience of NazgrekMorph), Hide level-up graphics
                Custom script:   call AbilityPoints_EnableHeroLevelUp()
                -------- Transfer Str / Agi / Int --------
                Hero - Modify Strength of Nazgrek: Set to (Strength of NazgrekMorph (Include bonuses)).
                Hero - Modify Agility of Nazgrek: Set to (Agility of NazgrekMorph (Include bonuses)).
                Hero - Modify Intelligence of Nazgrek: Set to (Intelligence of NazgrekMorph (Include bonuses)).
                -------- Transfer health --------
                Unit - Set life of Nazgrek to (Life of NazgrekMorph)
                -------- Transfer mana --------
                Unit - Set mana of Nazgrek to (Mana of NazgrekMorph)
                -------- Transfer Items --------
                For each (Integer MorphInteger) from 1 to 6, do (Actions)
                    Loop - Actions
                        Hero - Drop the item from slot MorphInteger of NazgrekMorph.
                        Hero - Give (Last dropped item) to Nazgrek
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_VarPoint)
                Unit - Hide NazgrekMorph
                Unit - Pause NazgrekMorph
                -------- tmp --------
                Set VariableSet Temp_Integer = (Custom value of Nazgrek)
                -------- LEVEL 1 --------
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        (Level of ENHANCEMENT_GhostWolfMorph  for (Triggering unit)) Equal to 1
                    Then - Actions
                        -------- Increase Crit and Dodge --------
                        Set VariableSet Stats_Dodge[Temp_Integer] = (Stats_Dodge[Temp_Integer] + 5)
                        -------- Set armor --------
                        Unit - Set Armor of Nazgrek to ((Armor of NazgrekMorph) + ((Armor of NazgrekMorph) x 0.50))
                        -------- Set dmg --------
                        Unit - Set Base Damage of Nazgrek to ((Base Damage of NazgrekMorph for weapon index 1) + ((Base Damage of NazgrekMorph for weapon index 1) x (Integer(0.20)))) for weapon index: 1
                    Else - Actions
